{"ordinal":13320,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452933361670","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wolfhound_Death_0013150","source":"Wolfhound: ХХААААА!","target":"Wolfhound: HAAA!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-336.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13321,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452933361669","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wolfhound_Death_0376ab4","source":"Wolfhound: Ну давай посмотрим, кто быстрее.","target":"Wolfhound: Hai să vedem care dintre noi e mai rapid.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-336.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13322,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452933361668","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wolfhound_Death_05e7e87","source":"Wolfhound: Из такого я уже выбирался.","target":"Wolfhound: Am mai scăpat eu din situații ca asta.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-336.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13323,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452933361667","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wolfhound_Ears_DontShoot_066c9ec","source":"Wolfhound: Перестань позориться.","target":"Wolfhound: Nu te mai face de râs.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-336.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13324,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452933361666","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wolfhound_Ears_DontShoot_05e2652","source":"Wolfhound: Успокойся и отдай ответственность нормальным людям.","target":"Wolfhound: Calmează-te și lasă răspunderea pe mâna unor oameni întregi la cap.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-336.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13325,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452933361665","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wolfhound_Photo_DontShoot_0393a37","source":"Wolfhound: А скоро ещё и в башку свою же попадёшь.","target":"Wolfhound: În curând o să te împuști singur în cap.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-336.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13326,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452933361664","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wolfhound_Photo_DontShoot_0c8fd39","source":"Wolfhound: Выглядишь как мальчишка, которому досталось по наследству что-то опасное. А ты им себе руки ломаешь.","target":"Wolfhound: Arăți ca un puști care a moștenit ceva periculos. Și cu acel lucru îți rupi singur mâinile.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-336.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13327,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452929167368","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wolfhound_Photo_DontShoot_02bdd9f","source":"Wolfhound: Это уже не серьёзно.","target":"Wolfhound: Asta nu mai e deloc serios.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-336.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13328,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452929167367","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wolfhound_Armpit_DontShoot_0b5c94b","source":"Wolfhound: Выкинешь ещё какую подлянку - мы с тобой отдельно поговорим.","target":"Wolfhound: Dacă mai faci vreo mârșăvie, o să avem noi doi o discuție aparte.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-336.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13329,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452929167366","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wolfhound_Armpit_DontShoot_0dfb6f8","source":"Wolfhound: Ты мне неприятен.","target":"Wolfhound: Nu te pot suferi.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-336.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13330,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452929167365","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wolfhound_Eyes_DontShoot_0e99e37","source":"Wolfhound: Если ты берёшься за ружьё и не ипользуешь его, то так видна твоя неуверенность. А это опасно для тебя же.","target":"Wolfhound: Dacă pui mâna pe pușcă și n-o folosești, îți trădezi nesiguranța. Iar asta e periculos chiar pentru tine.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-336.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13331,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452929167364","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wolfhound_Eyes_DontShoot_0b7bf78","source":"Wolfhound: Ошибся я в тебе.","target":"Wolfhound: M-am înșelat în privința ta.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-336.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13332,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452929167363","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wolfhound_Eyes_DontShoot_0a01d64","source":"Wolfhound: Спокойно, опускай-опускай.","target":"Wolfhound: Ușor, las-o jos, las-o jos.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-336.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13333,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452929167362","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wolfhound_Hands_DontShoot_089e2f7","source":"Wolfhound: И тогда ружьё будет у меня.","target":"Wolfhound: Și atunci pușca va fi la mine.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-336.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13334,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452929167361","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wolfhound_Hands_DontShoot_06119cc","source":"Wolfhound: Я ведь могу быстрее тебя оказаться.","target":"Wolfhound: Pot ajunge înaintea ta.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-336.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13335,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452929167360","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wolfhound_Teeth_DontShoot_08fb8f2","source":"Wolfhound: Не делай ошибок.","target":"Wolfhound: Nu face greșeli.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-336.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13336,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452924973063","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wolfhound_Teeth_DontShoot_0531ec7","source":"Wolfhound: И если что — я тебя живьём загрызу, дитя.","target":"Wolfhound: Și, la nevoie, te sfâșii de viu cu dinții, puștiule.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-336.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13337,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452924973062","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wolfhound_Teeth_DontShoot_0fc7118","source":"Wolfhound: Я же знаю, когда и сколько ты спишь.","target":"Wolfhound: Știu când dormi și cât dormi.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-336.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13338,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452924973061","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wolfhound_Teeth_DontShoot_0cac22d","source":"Wolfhound: Ты на меня больше ружьё не наводи.","target":"Wolfhound: Să nu mai îndrepți pușca spre mine.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-336.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
